---
import { navigation } from '../data/site';
---

<footer class="site-footer section-shell" id="contact">
  <div class="footer-top">
    <a class="wordmark" href="#top">
      LOVE LABELS<sup>®</sup>
    </a>
    <p>
      Have someone in mind?
      <br />
      <a href="#personalize" class="text-link">
        LET’S MAKE IT PERSONAL{' '}
        <svg class="arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" />
        </svg>
      </a>
    </p>
    <div class="footer-links">
      {navigation.map((item) => (
        <a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>
      ))}
      <button data-info="faq">FAQ</button>
      <button data-info="shipping">Shipping</button>
      <button data-info="contact">
        Get in touch{' '}
        <svg class="arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" />
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="footer-statement">
    ORDINARY CAN.
    <br />
    <span>PERSONAL STORY.</span>
  </p>
  <div class="footer-bottom">
    <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} LOVE LABELS</span>
    <span>MADE TO MEAN SOMETHING.</span>
    <div>
      <button data-info="terms">Terms</button>
      <button data-info="privacy">Privacy</button>
      <a href="#top" aria-label="Back to top">
        ↑
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
<dialog id="info-dialog" class="info-dialog" aria-labelledby="info-title">
  <div class="dialog-top">
    <span class="wordmark">
      LOVE LABELS<sup>®</sup>
    </span>
    <button class="icon-button" data-close-dialog aria-label="Close information">
      ×
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="info-content">
    <p class="eyebrow">THE SMALL PRINT. SIMPLY PUT.</p>
    <h2 id="info-title"></h2>
    <div id="info-body"></div>
  </div>
</dialog>
<template id="info-faq">
  <details open>
    <summary>Am I buying the drink?</summary>
    <p>
      The product is a personalized vinyl label. You provide a standard European 250 ml slim can and
      wrap the label around it.
    </p>
  </details>
  <details>
    <summary>How do I apply the label?</summary>
    <p>
      Start with a clean, dry can at room temperature. Peel back one edge, align it vertically, then
      smooth the label around the can a little at a time.
    </p>
  </details>
  <details>
    <summary>Can I use a photo?</summary>
    <p>
      Yes. Add a JPG, PNG or WebP image in the studio. Your image stays in your browser and is
      included when you download your design.
    </p>
  </details>
  <details>
    <summary>Will it fit any can?</summary>
    <p>
      The designs are intended for standard European 250 ml slim cans. Shapes and dimensions vary,
      so confirm your can’s measurements before printing. The downloadable SVG is a design proof,
      not a production dieline.
    </p>
  </details>
  <details>
    <summary>Can I order for a wedding or a team?</summary>
    <p>
      The studio supports wedding and team designs. Save your design and an enquiry brief to prepare
      your request. Online ordering is not open yet.
    </p>
  </details>
</template>
<template id="info-shipping">
  <p>
    Online ordering is not open yet. Shipping destinations, pricing, production times and delivery
    options will be available before orders are accepted.
  </p>
  <p>You can create and download a design now. No payment is taken in this studio.</p>
  <a href="#personalize" data-close-dialog class="text-link">
    CREATE A DESIGN{' '}
    <svg class="arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" />
    </svg>
  </a>
</template>
<template id="info-contact">
  <p>
    Planning a birthday, wedding or something for your team? Prepare an enquiry with the details
    below. Download it to keep with your label design.
  </p>
  <form id="enquiry-form">
    <div class="field">
      <label for="enquiry-name">YOUR NAME</label>
      <input id="enquiry-name" name="name" required maxlength="100" autocomplete="name" />
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="enquiry-email">YOUR EMAIL</label>
      <input
        id="enquiry-email"
        name="email"
        type="email"
        required
        maxlength="200"
        autocomplete="email"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="enquiry-message">WHAT DO YOU HAVE IN MIND?</label>
      <textarea
        id="enquiry-message"
        name="message"
        required
        maxlength="2000"
        rows="4"
        placeholder="Occasion, quantity, date and any little details…"
      ></textarea>
    </div>
    <button class="button button--light" type="submit">
      SAVE MY ENQUIRY <span>↓</span>
    </button>
    <p class="review-note">
      This saves a file to your device. Nothing is sent or submitted. A contact address will be
      added when ordering opens.
    </p>
    <p role="status" id="enquiry-status"></p>
  </form>
</template>
<template id="info-terms">
  <p>
    This website currently offers an interactive design preview. It does not accept orders or
    payments and does not create a purchase agreement.
  </p>
  <p>
    Downloaded designs are visual proofs. Final dimensions, print specifications, prices, fulfilment
    and purchase terms must be agreed before production.
  </p>
  <p>
    Only upload images and messages you have permission to use. All supplied artwork is illustrative
    and may be replaced before the store launches.
  </p>
</template>
<template id="info-privacy">
  <p>
    Your name, message, occasion and color choices are saved locally in your browser so you can
    return to your design. Uploaded photos stay in the current page session and are not uploaded to
    a server.
  </p>
  <p>
    Downloaded design files include the photo and text you selected. Enquiry forms generate a local
    file; they do not send your details anywhere.
  </p>
  <p>
    This version uses no analytics, advertising trackers or third-party fonts. Your hosting provider
    may maintain standard access logs. A full privacy notice with the store operator’s details will
    be published before ordering opens.
  </p>
  <button id="clear-design" class="button button--outline" type="button">
    CLEAR MY SAVED DESIGN <span>×</span>
  </button>
  <p id="clear-status" role="status"></p>
</template>
